= extend('/layout')

= content('title', 'append')
  title About &middot; Nitrous

.hero.main.notice-after
  .container
    h2 Nitrous Inc.
    h4.subtitle Level up your development

.notice
  .container
    p
      | We're Hiring! Come change the way the world codes.
      a href="/jobs"  Check out our open positions &raquo

.hero.people
  .container
    p.big
      | Nitrous builds tools for developers of all kinds. With offices in San Francisco and Singapore, the company launched one of the first collaborative cloud IDEs in 2012, and in 2016 launched PubStorm, a static site hosting provider.

    .flex-list.people
       .flex-item
         img alt="Scott Collison" src="/images/company/collison.png"
         p.name
           | Scott Collison
         p.title
           | CEO
         p.bio
           | Scott has a deep knowledge of platforms and cloud computing with three successful startup exits - one in excess of $1b. He has managed teams at Microsoft, Salesforce and VMWare.
       .flex-item
         img alt="Pete" src="/images/company/pete.png"
         p.name
           | Pete Kim
         p.title
           | CTO
         p.bio
           | Pete started programming at the age of 8, and has never stopped. A co-founder of Nitrous, Pete frequently contributes to open source and in his free time, enjoys road cycling.
       .flex-item
         img alt="Arabella" src="/images/company/arabella.png"
         p.name
           | Arabella David
         p.title
           | VP Marketing
         p.bio
           | Arabella has more than 15 years of developer marketing experience with global companies including Microsoft, Nokia, and Nest Labs.


.hero.investors
  .container
    img src='/images/company/bvp-logo.png' width='315px' height='80px' alt='Bessemer Venture Partners logo'
    p
      | Bessemer Venture Partners led Nitrous' Seed and Series A financing rounds.
    p
      | Bessemer Venture Partners (BVP) invests in early-stage and hyper-growth startups, partnering closely with entrepreneurs to build durable businesses. With $4.5 billion under management, BVP invests anywhere from $100,000 to $75 million in innovative companies like Pinterest, Twilio, Box, Twitch,LinkedIn, Shopify, Yelp, Skype and Nitrous. Over 100 BVP companies have gone public – in the last three years alone, BVP has had 46 exits (IPO and M&A) and made new investments in more than 85 companies. Learn more at
      a href="http://www.bvp.com/"  www.bvp.com
      | .

= partial('/partials/map')
